WEBVTT

00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:06.610
I'm counting on you then, Millihi-nee.

00:00:06.920 --> 00:00:07.730
Sure.

00:00:07.730 --> 00:00:08.920
You too, Rebecca.

00:00:08.920 --> 00:00:10.990
I'm counting on you to 
guard and escort my sister.

00:00:10.990 --> 00:00:13.520
You can count on me.

00:00:13.520 --> 00:00:17.680
This is a traditional event 
held once a year in Pastillage.

00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:20.010
The Esnart Arts and Music Festival.

00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:23.880
Held in their greatest concert hall,

00:00:23.880 --> 00:00:25.890
this is their biggest musical event.

00:00:26.210 --> 00:00:28.080
People come from all over

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:31.300
and the entire town is infected 
with the spirit of festival.

00:00:31.630 --> 00:00:33.270
The princess has also been invited

00:00:33.270 --> 00:00:37.000
to perform on stage as a singer.

00:02:13.270 --> 00:02:17.070
Esnart Arts and Music Festival

00:02:17.250 --> 00:02:21.370
These clothes and shoes 
sure are easy to move in.

00:02:21.370 --> 00:02:22.320
Yeah, huh?

00:02:22.320 --> 00:02:24.950
It's good that you wear 
the same size as Nanami.

00:02:25.220 --> 00:02:27.000
That's perfect.

00:02:27.590 --> 00:02:30.430
I guess the clothes are a little 
big, since they're mine.

00:02:30.430 --> 00:02:32.460
No, they're just right.

00:02:32.460 --> 00:02:35.110
You even made an opening for my tail.

00:02:35.110 --> 00:02:36.630
Becky did that.

00:02:37.230 --> 00:02:39.350
Is everything okay with the princess?

00:02:39.350 --> 00:02:41.640
I talked to her a bit, before she left.

00:02:42.100 --> 00:02:46.230
Besides, Becky will be 
by the princess's side today.

00:02:47.170 --> 00:02:51.130
My walk with Rebecca was so much fun.

00:02:51.130 --> 00:02:52.720
I'm glad to hear it.

00:02:53.480 --> 00:02:55.120
And what did you do today?

00:02:55.120 --> 00:02:56.620
We played catch

00:02:56.620 --> 00:03:00.070
and then we both got on Mercurius 
and rode through the sky.

00:03:00.310 --> 00:03:02.020
That does indeed sound like fun.

00:03:02.020 --> 00:03:03.070
It was!

00:03:07.520 --> 00:03:09.180
Thank you very much.

00:03:09.180 --> 00:03:11.400
We'll get in the bath ourselves,

00:03:11.400 --> 00:03:13.300
so you may all go ahead and take a break.

00:03:13.300 --> 00:03:14.380
Yes.

00:03:15.320 --> 00:03:16.870
I do apologize though.

00:03:16.870 --> 00:03:18.450
I know your morning walk

00:03:18.450 --> 00:03:21.490
is your time to go out 
together with Sink.

00:03:22.550 --> 00:03:25.390
I have fun with you, too.

00:03:25.390 --> 00:03:26.390
Really?

00:03:26.390 --> 00:03:27.510
Of course!

00:03:33.130 --> 00:03:35.030
That reminds me.

00:03:35.030 --> 00:03:37.630
You're not spending as much 
time with Sink as I expected.

00:03:37.630 --> 00:03:42.400
Yes. His work and my work are 
just so completely different.

00:03:43.880 --> 00:03:45.990
But every day this summer,

00:03:45.990 --> 00:03:47.950
we've made sure to begin 
and end the day together.

00:03:47.950 --> 00:03:49.250
In the morning we take our walk,

00:03:49.250 --> 00:03:51.480
and in the evening we study together.

00:03:51.480 --> 00:03:53.390
We enjoy each day.

00:03:53.390 --> 00:03:54.470
Oh, yeah.

00:03:54.470 --> 00:03:56.440
You study in your room, don't you?

00:03:56.440 --> 00:03:59.820
I can already write all the 
hiragana and the alphabet.

00:03:59.820 --> 00:04:01.300
That's great!

00:04:01.930 --> 00:04:06.220
I always think I'm very lucky 
to have Sink as our hero.

00:04:06.220 --> 00:04:07.740
Yeah!

00:04:08.900 --> 00:04:11.270
So Princess...

00:04:11.270 --> 00:04:12.850
Yes?

00:04:12.850 --> 00:04:16.930
Have you ever thought you might like 
to marry Sink at some point?

00:04:16.930 --> 00:04:19.050
Rebecca-san!

00:04:19.050 --> 00:04:23.000
I still haven't... I haven't 
even considered such a thing.

00:04:23.810 --> 00:04:25.490
You say "still", so does that mean

00:04:25.490 --> 00:04:26.830
you'd consider it in the future?

00:04:26.830 --> 00:04:28.080
That's not what I meant.

00:04:28.330 --> 00:04:30.290
No need to be shy.

00:04:30.290 --> 00:04:33.700
I think it would be nice, if it happened,

00:04:33.700 --> 00:04:36.140
but Sink is from Earth after all.

00:04:36.140 --> 00:04:38.670
You're here, too.

00:04:38.670 --> 00:04:40.560
It doesn't bother me at all.

00:04:40.560 --> 00:04:45.110
If you love Sink and he loves you,

00:04:45.110 --> 00:04:47.280
then I support you both 
with all my heart.

00:04:47.280 --> 00:04:48.850
That's not okay!

00:04:48.850 --> 00:04:52.010
After all, you love him, too.

00:04:52.600 --> 00:04:53.430
Huh?

00:04:53.430 --> 00:04:55.140
You say you're all right with it,

00:04:55.140 --> 00:04:58.670
but I bet you'd be very sad 
if it ever actually happened.

00:04:59.930 --> 00:05:03.610
I guess it would be a lie if I said it 
wouldn't make me feel lonely at all.

00:05:06.630 --> 00:05:09.910
Sink and I are basically family.

00:05:09.910 --> 00:05:14.370
It guess I'm also afraid of 
changing what we have now...

00:05:14.370 --> 00:05:15.990
Yes.

00:05:15.990 --> 00:05:20.560
The truth is, I really like our 
relationship right now, too.

00:05:20.560 --> 00:05:25.020
It's so warm, and exciting, 
and just plain nice.

00:05:25.020 --> 00:05:27.920
Being together is so fun and pleasant.

00:05:27.920 --> 00:05:28.760
Exactly.

00:05:29.050 --> 00:05:31.680
So I'm afraid that we might lose that,

00:05:31.680 --> 00:05:33.590
if I try to change something,

00:05:33.590 --> 00:05:36.440
and I wouldn't know what to do then...

00:05:36.440 --> 00:05:38.190
That's exactly what I mean!

00:05:40.900 --> 00:05:44.680
I bet Sink wants 
to focus on athletics

00:05:44.680 --> 00:05:48.200
and his role as Hero for a while.

00:05:48.400 --> 00:05:50.280
I know what you mean.

00:05:50.640 --> 00:05:55.580
That's why I let a few years go by 
without being able to say anything.

00:05:55.580 --> 00:05:57.020
That's me.

00:05:58.210 --> 00:06:02.290
Still, I actually like the 
way we are now, too.

00:06:02.820 --> 00:06:05.100
We're childhood friends 
who are more than friends,

00:06:05.100 --> 00:06:06.690
but not quite family...

00:06:06.690 --> 00:06:10.050
I get just a little bit 
of special treatment...

00:06:10.870 --> 00:06:13.100
What used to scare me the most

00:06:13.630 --> 00:06:17.150
was being the third wheel,

00:06:17.150 --> 00:06:20.060
if he ever fell in love with someone.

00:06:21.660 --> 00:06:26.440
That I'd have to keep my distance 
and give up a lot of things...

00:06:26.770 --> 00:06:28.230
Yes.

00:06:28.230 --> 00:06:30.450
Which is why you have to be

00:06:30.700 --> 00:06:34.240
that most important person for him.

00:06:34.870 --> 00:06:39.710
It's not easy though.

00:06:39.710 --> 00:06:41.740
I've gotten to like you so much, too.

00:06:41.740 --> 00:06:44.340
You're so kind, Princess.

00:06:44.340 --> 00:06:45.840
I love you, too!

00:06:52.790 --> 00:06:56.890
In the end, it's all up to Sink,

00:06:56.890 --> 00:07:00.980
but he just loves everybody he meets.

00:07:01.280 --> 00:07:04.190
That's what's so wonderful about him.

00:07:04.490 --> 00:07:06.570
He loves everyone,

00:07:06.570 --> 00:07:10.700
he's always so positive,
 and that's what I love about him.

00:07:10.700 --> 00:07:12.610
Yeah. Me, too.

00:07:13.780 --> 00:07:18.370
Then again, it's not like I 
don't have my problems with him.

00:07:18.370 --> 00:07:20.370
Really? Like what?

00:07:20.680 --> 00:07:24.750
Like... but this is between us, okay?

00:07:28.190 --> 00:07:31.010
Oh really. I can see that.

00:07:31.330 --> 00:07:36.310
Well, I just hope he notices one day.

00:07:36.310 --> 00:07:39.270
We can't tell him though.

00:07:39.550 --> 00:07:41.150
I promise I'll keep it a secret,

00:07:41.150 --> 00:07:43.650
so that maybe he'll see it himself.

00:07:43.650 --> 00:07:46.470
Yeah. It'll be our secret.

00:07:48.820 --> 00:07:52.400
Galette Northeast - Near the Border 
Mithha Mountain

00:07:54.760 --> 00:07:57.550
Looks like a band of 
highwayman-rabbits to me.

00:07:57.550 --> 00:07:59.750
They seem to be peaceful though.

00:08:00.240 --> 00:08:04.750
Nanami and I caught the ones 
who stumbled into Ayase.

00:08:05.000 --> 00:08:10.150
This is their original habitat, 
so we just brought them back.

00:08:10.150 --> 00:08:13.260
Their boss looks sick or something.

00:08:13.260 --> 00:08:14.270
Big brother.

00:08:14.270 --> 00:08:15.510
Valerie.

00:08:15.510 --> 00:08:16.760
Yes?

00:08:17.070 --> 00:08:19.260
I'm sorry we kept you waiting.

00:08:20.210 --> 00:08:22.410
How's the base of the hill looking?

00:08:22.410 --> 00:08:25.190
It seems no harm was done.

00:08:26.590 --> 00:08:29.610
We did notice one thing...

00:08:30.770 --> 00:08:34.780
Apparently, one of them had 
a rather strange form.

00:08:34.780 --> 00:08:37.270
She looked like a young girl

00:08:37.270 --> 00:08:41.620
and seemed very close to the boss-rabbit.

00:08:42.170 --> 00:08:46.880
However, nobody has seen her lately.

00:08:46.880 --> 00:08:48.940
The band has split up to look for her

00:08:48.940 --> 00:08:51.630
and entered human settlements.

00:08:51.810 --> 00:08:55.300
Do you think she's in a 
human settlement, too?

00:08:55.300 --> 00:08:59.300
I just hope it's not some 
kind of dangerous demon.

00:09:09.510 --> 00:09:12.360
Ma'am, how about these?

00:09:14.760 --> 00:09:15.590
Huh?

00:09:23.950 --> 00:09:25.590
Are you all right?

00:09:26.520 --> 00:09:27.500
This is bad!

00:09:30.610 --> 00:09:35.820
Princess Millihiore, our special guest 
at the opening day of our music festival,

00:09:35.820 --> 00:09:38.720
has just arrived at Eschenbach Palace.

00:09:38.720 --> 00:09:43.280
Her clothing and accessories 
are as adorable as always.

00:09:55.110 --> 00:09:57.790
The number of people here is crazy.

00:09:57.790 --> 00:10:00.330
Even the outdoor seating is full.

00:10:00.330 --> 00:10:02.590
There are, apparently, over twice 
as many people here as last year.

00:10:02.590 --> 00:10:04.870
We'll need to keep security tight.

00:10:04.870 --> 00:10:05.870
Yeah!

00:10:10.130 --> 00:10:13.620
You won't be going out until pretty 
late in the second half, right?

00:10:13.620 --> 00:10:14.850
Yes,

00:10:14.850 --> 00:10:16.880
so we can relax for a bit.

00:10:17.160 --> 00:10:19.580
It's really amazing though,

00:10:19.580 --> 00:10:22.890
that you'll be singing in 
front of all those people.

00:10:23.120 --> 00:10:25.150
I do love to sing,

00:10:25.150 --> 00:10:27.890
and I am happy if they're 
letting me sing.

00:10:28.140 --> 00:10:30.390
But still...

00:10:30.390 --> 00:10:30.910
Yes?

00:10:31.020 --> 00:10:34.150
I still get nervous when 
I'm getting up on stage.

00:10:34.400 --> 00:10:36.060
What if I screw up the plan,

00:10:36.060 --> 00:10:39.470
or what if I read the crowd wrong?

00:10:40.330 --> 00:10:42.430
You'll be fine, Princess.

00:10:42.430 --> 00:10:43.240
I got it.

00:10:43.240 --> 00:10:44.870
Why don't we call Sink?

00:10:49.200 --> 00:10:50.760
Yes? Sink here.

00:10:50.760 --> 00:10:51.920
Hi, Sink.

00:10:51.920 --> 00:10:53.010
Are you in the middle of work?

00:10:53.010 --> 00:10:53.630
Yeah.

00:10:53.980 --> 00:10:56.800
I'm helping Rico and the others 
set up the vendor stalls.

00:10:56.800 --> 00:10:57.770
Is something going on?

00:10:57.770 --> 00:11:00.140
Well, the princess is nervous

00:11:00.140 --> 00:11:01.890
and she could use some cheering up.

00:11:01.890 --> 00:11:02.890
Roger!

00:11:03.580 --> 00:11:07.390
I'm sorry to bother you during work.

00:11:07.390 --> 00:11:08.600
You're not bothering me at all.

00:11:08.600 --> 00:11:11.270
Don't worry, Princess. 
Just give it your best.

00:11:11.480 --> 00:11:12.560
I will!

00:11:12.560 --> 00:11:15.270
I'll try to sing like I always do.

00:11:36.770 --> 00:11:38.330
Are you performing here?

00:11:38.330 --> 00:11:39.960
Regular guests are not 
allowed back here...

00:11:51.920 --> 00:11:52.690
Yes?

00:11:54.230 --> 00:11:56.190
It's one of the knights.

00:11:56.190 --> 00:11:57.520
Is something wrong?

00:12:13.070 --> 00:12:13.830
I'm so sorry.

00:12:13.830 --> 00:12:15.150
Are you all right, Princess?

00:12:15.150 --> 00:12:16.550
Yes, are you all right?

00:12:20.060 --> 00:12:22.470
Stop right there, you jewel thief!

00:12:39.580 --> 00:12:41.360
No!

00:12:51.600 --> 00:12:54.210
These are very precious to...

00:12:55.600 --> 00:12:58.800
Cou-sama, the princess, and everybody!

00:13:11.760 --> 00:13:13.910
This is an emergency call 
to all security personnel.

00:13:13.910 --> 00:13:15.650
A young female robber

00:13:15.650 --> 00:13:17.770
has invaded Princess 
Millihiore's green room.

00:13:17.770 --> 00:13:19.920
She was beaten back by Rebecca-sama.

00:13:19.920 --> 00:13:22.520
Both she and the princess are fine.

00:13:22.900 --> 00:13:24.270
The robber uses magic

00:13:24.270 --> 00:13:26.500
to control the bodies of her opponents.

00:13:26.910 --> 00:13:29.230
Could this be some kind of demon?

00:13:29.230 --> 00:13:32.010
No. If she controls the 
bodies of her victims,

00:13:32.010 --> 00:13:32.910
then she must be a...

00:13:49.830 --> 00:13:50.680
Catch her!

00:14:35.140 --> 00:14:36.390
Transform!

00:14:36.390 --> 00:14:38.850
Hero Crystal Hero Time.

00:14:39.640 --> 00:14:40.900
The Hero...

00:14:49.800 --> 00:14:51.570
You're deflecting her control?

00:14:51.570 --> 00:14:53.470
Is this the power of the Hero Crystal?!

00:14:54.020 --> 00:14:57.640
Now you're going to give 
back all the things you stole.

00:15:00.220 --> 00:15:01.420
Eclair, let's get her!

00:15:01.420 --> 00:15:02.420
Yeah!

00:15:09.090 --> 00:15:10.470
She sure is fast!

00:15:10.470 --> 00:15:13.420
Judging by her skills, I'd say 
she's the child of a local god.

00:15:13.420 --> 00:15:15.510
Most likely, a descendant of a cat god.

00:15:15.510 --> 00:15:17.100
Local god, you say?

00:15:17.100 --> 00:15:19.190
Then we can't be too rough with her.

00:15:19.190 --> 00:15:22.610
But we have to get back 
everything she stole.

00:15:22.610 --> 00:15:24.770
If we're careful, we can 
do it without getting hurt.

00:15:24.770 --> 00:15:27.030
Then let's go get her!

00:15:32.490 --> 00:15:34.070
Fast Wind Blade!

00:15:50.990 --> 00:15:52.290
Good job, Eclair.

00:15:53.030 --> 00:15:55.510
Oh, that was nothing.

00:15:56.130 --> 00:15:58.710
It looks like they caught the thief!

00:15:59.610 --> 00:16:02.520
They also recovered all 
the items she stole.

00:16:02.760 --> 00:16:04.770
That's wonderful!

00:16:08.820 --> 00:16:12.360
I guess she really 
was a lost local god.

00:16:12.360 --> 00:16:14.950
I'm glad she didn't get hurt.

00:16:15.340 --> 00:16:20.700
We will make sure to bring this 
cat god safely back to Mithha.

00:16:20.700 --> 00:16:22.550
Excuse me.

00:16:22.550 --> 00:16:23.210
Just one moment.

00:16:26.010 --> 00:16:28.670
This is for you, cat god.

00:16:29.320 --> 00:16:32.470
I got it as a souvenir 
at one of the booths,

00:16:32.650 --> 00:16:34.410
but I'll give it to you.

00:16:37.190 --> 00:16:39.100
Owwowowowow!

00:16:40.030 --> 00:16:43.730
No cat god! You're not 
supposed to bite it!

00:16:44.100 --> 00:16:47.010
I don't think a young, wild cat god

00:16:47.010 --> 00:16:50.100
understands too many words.

00:16:50.100 --> 00:16:51.240
Yeah, huh?

00:16:57.990 --> 00:17:00.630
I guess, even if we go back now,

00:17:00.630 --> 00:17:03.320
we won't make it in time 
for the princess's performance.

00:17:03.320 --> 00:17:05.870
I guess we can watch a recording.

00:17:08.570 --> 00:17:09.960
We'll make it.

00:17:09.960 --> 00:17:10.900
Get on!

00:17:10.900 --> 00:17:12.860
It's the Hero Super 
Express, Hyper Edition!

00:17:12.860 --> 00:17:14.380
What he said!

00:17:18.050 --> 00:17:21.190
Wow, this is incredible!

00:17:21.190 --> 00:17:23.380
This brings back memories.

00:17:23.380 --> 00:17:26.850
This is just like when 
we first met, Sink.

00:17:26.850 --> 00:17:27.650
Yeah, huh.

00:17:27.930 --> 00:17:30.520
You've grown up, Sink.

00:17:30.520 --> 00:17:33.000
I'm overcome with emotion...

00:17:33.000 --> 00:17:37.020
No, no, I think you've 
got that a bit wrong.

00:17:37.020 --> 00:17:42.410
Normal Hero or big Hero, 
they're both great!

00:17:42.790 --> 00:17:43.960
Jeez.

00:17:47.830 --> 00:17:48.880
Ecle?

00:17:48.880 --> 00:17:50.350
Is something wrong?

00:17:50.350 --> 00:17:52.680
It's nothing!

00:17:53.910 --> 00:17:55.660
There's something in our path!

00:17:56.800 --> 00:17:57.700
Evade!

00:17:57.700 --> 00:17:59.770
Watch where you're going!

00:18:02.850 --> 00:18:04.430
Good evening, everyone!

00:18:05.040 --> 00:18:08.480
I just want to tell you how 
absolutely wonderful it is

00:18:08.480 --> 00:18:12.370
to stand on Pastillage's legendary 
stage again this year.

00:18:12.370 --> 00:18:14.690
I am so, so very happy 
to see you all, again.

00:18:17.210 --> 00:18:18.910
We made it.

00:18:18.910 --> 00:18:21.080
Quiet now.

00:18:21.430 --> 00:18:22.770
The day after tomorrow,

00:18:22.770 --> 00:18:25.780
the three nations of Pastillage, 
Biscotti, and Galette

00:18:25.780 --> 00:18:30.200
will combine forces to 
host one huge event.

00:18:31.820 --> 00:18:33.590
Of course we will be there,

00:18:33.590 --> 00:18:38.610
as well as knights, Heroes, 
and everybody else,

00:18:38.610 --> 00:18:40.830
all ensuring that it 
will be a great event!

00:18:43.340 --> 00:18:47.490
Now, please listen 
to the Union Fest song,

00:18:48.110 --> 00:18:49.790
"Heart Relation".

00:19:08.160 --> 00:19:11.340
You were always by my side,

00:19:11.340 --> 00:19:14.590
always right next to me.

00:19:14.590 --> 00:19:17.430
That's why we could

00:19:17.430 --> 00:19:21.010
embrace the same hopes.

00:19:24.180 --> 00:19:25.180
I want to stretch

00:19:25.180 --> 00:19:27.500
out this hand

00:19:27.500 --> 00:19:30.390
and touch you.

00:19:30.390 --> 00:19:31.990
Listen to the

00:19:31.990 --> 00:19:33.410
first beat

00:19:33.410 --> 00:19:35.980
of my heart.

00:19:36.920 --> 00:19:37.880
I'm sure

00:19:37.880 --> 00:19:39.990
we'll have a connection.

00:19:39.990 --> 00:19:40.950
Inscribe

00:19:40.950 --> 00:19:43.160
it in the sky.

00:19:43.160 --> 00:19:46.200
Gather more courage.

00:19:46.200 --> 00:19:47.620
Be strong.

00:19:47.620 --> 00:19:49.160
Be strong,

00:19:49.160 --> 00:19:52.580
so that we can bind

00:19:52.580 --> 00:19:56.590
our hearts!

00:19:59.620 --> 00:20:04.420
Under the blue sky...

00:20:02.870 --> 00:20:06.510
<i>Under the blue sky...</i>

00:20:05.900 --> 00:20:10.480
The echo of the bell...

00:20:10.050 --> 00:20:15.840
<i>The echo of the bell...</i>

00:20:12.480 --> 00:20:16.440
Listen to it.

00:20:16.660 --> 00:20:20.740
The beginning

00:20:20.740 --> 00:20:25.160
is right there.

00:20:28.010 --> 00:20:29.020
I'm sure

00:20:29.020 --> 00:20:31.120
we'll have a connection.

00:20:31.120 --> 00:20:34.330
Let it reverberate through the sky.

00:20:34.330 --> 00:20:37.340
Gather your love and courage.

00:20:37.340 --> 00:20:38.890
Be strong.

00:20:38.890 --> 00:20:40.550
Be strong,

00:20:40.550 --> 00:20:42.120
so that our hearts

00:20:42.120 --> 00:20:49.590
will never part.

00:21:01.310 --> 00:21:05.360
The musical festival was a huge success,

00:21:05.360 --> 00:21:07.230
but there wasn't much 
time to rest afterwards

00:21:07.230 --> 00:21:09.550
because the next huge event was upon us.

00:21:11.400 --> 00:21:14.950
Finally, tomorrow we have the three 
countries' great joint event.

00:21:14.950 --> 00:21:16.710
Let's give it all we've got.

00:21:16.710 --> 00:21:17.710
Yeah!

00:21:20.000 --> 00:21:24.610
It is Galette's pride to win anything 
that bears the war moniker!

00:21:24.610 --> 00:21:27.090
It is obvious that we will win!

00:21:33.250 --> 00:21:35.480
Let's do our best, Sink.

00:21:35.480 --> 00:21:38.360
Let's, Princess!

00:23:33.460 --> 00:23:35.920
Oh no, my body isn't obeying me...

00:23:35.100 --> 00:23:45.000
<b>Union Fest</b>

00:23:35.920 --> 00:23:39.320
Princess, even now your 
dance moves are so elegant.
